  "description": "AL symbol restore and config-driven multi-project build tool for Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central.\n      Declarative alwasp.json config with apps/tests inventory, profiles, and targets.\n      Deterministic symbol restore from NuGet feeds with incremental manifest caching.\n      Also includes static AL source analysis (alwasp analyze), XLIFF translation coverage\n      validation (alwasp validate translations), and structured json/ndjson output.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "left-code.AlWasp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
