  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Compatibility validation with --changed-since downloads baselines only for changed apps and runs without any baseline source (current-source validation).\n      Discovers rulesets from the AL al.ruleSetPath setting, and no longer treats ordinary #if conditionals as unclassifiable projects.\n      CHANGELOG.md contains the complete details.",
